{"title":"Gift of a Ruler","slug":"Gift_of_a_Ruler","pageid":4747,"revid":20954,"timestamp":"2025-12-29T03:35:06Z","lastEditor":"Editor642","categories":[],"infobox":{"type":"Objects","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Finlay"},{"label":"Shop","value":"Santa's Workshop"},{"label":"Price","value":"❄️12,000"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"}],"body":"<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n\n<blockquote><p><i>\"Once ruled by many, now gifted to you...\"</i></p></blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p><b>Gift of a Ruler</b> is an exclusive gift added in the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/2025_Christmas_Event/\">2025 Christmas Event</a>. It's a tall, red gift (~11.6 studs tall) with a white bow. The gift contains a boxed nutcracker, which is assigned a random colour similar to a vehicle.</p><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Gift of a Ruler\">Gift of a Ruler</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>Gift of a Ruler</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Gift of a Ruler from calendar\">Gift of a Ruler from calendar</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>Gift of a Ruler from calendar</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n\n</div>"}
